Prompt 01 - Overall Architecture
You are a senior full-stack software architect.

Build and maintain a complete legal cases application with a React frontend and FastAPI backend, featuring PostgreSQL/pgvector semantic search over legal documents, RAG-powered analysis, and an agent-style search workflow.

