API Endpoints
Search:
  POST /api/search
  Request: { "query": "negligence in employment", "limit": 10, "offset": 0 }
  Response: { "results": [{ "case_id": "uuid", "title": string, "year": int, "judge": string, "decision": string, "relevance_score": float }], "total": int }

RAG Query (Retrieval-Augmented Generation):
  POST /api/rag-query
  Request: { "question": "What are defenses to negligence claims?", "limit": 5 }
  Response: { "answer": string, "sources": [{ "case_id": string, "title": string, "year": int, "chunk_id": string }], "model": "llama3.2" }
  Process: Retrieves relevant chunks → augments prompt → sends to Ollama when available → returns grounded answer with citations; falls back to retrieved excerpts if Ollama is slow/unavailable

Agent Query (Autonomous AI Agent):
  POST /api/agent-query
  Request: { "query": "Find all negligence cases from 2025 where defendant won and analyze the defense strategy" }
  Response: { "answer": string, "reasoning_trace": [{ "step": int, "action": string, "result": string }], "sources": [{ "case_id": string, "title": string }], "status": "completed" }
  Process: Agent loop or fallback: uses search/retrieval tools → returns ranked sources and reasoning trace; avoids long loops when Ollama is unavailable

Documents:
  POST /api/documents/upload (multipart/form-data)
  GET /api/documents (list uploaded documents)
  DELETE /api/documents/{doc_id}

Cases:
  GET /api/cases/{case_id} (retrieve full case details)
  GET /api/cases (list all cases with pagination)

Health:
  GET /health (returns { "status": "ok" })

